    {
      "id": "iXC4YyowpQLBRSMw5r1y6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2336,
      "y": 526,
      "width": 642.3399047851562,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1116885918,
      "version": 543,
      "versionNonce": 1971088450,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763498755897,
      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "text": "先用ajax把token传给后台, 不下载文件\n后台给一个临时的cookie, 过期时间非常短, 很快就失效了\n浏览器会自动保存cookie\n用js生成a元素, 并自动触发a元素的点击(a元素的点击会带着cookie过去)\n服务器验证cookie通过后, 后续流程就和a标签的下载一样了, 流式传输",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "先用ajax把token传给后台, 不下载文件\n后台给一个临时的cookie, 过期时间非常短, 很快就失效了\n浏览器会自动保存cookie\n用js生成a元素, 并自动触发a元素的点击(a元素的点击会带着cookie过去)\n服务器验证cookie通过后, 后续流程就和a标签的下载一样了, 流式传输",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
